abstract: >-
  Exact fixed-gadget scenario-cover results for a planar four-terminal
  splittable-to-unsplittable flow construction, including one-, two-, three-,
  and many-positive-scenario constants, a finite cover atlas, a fixed-family
  bounded-heterogeneity phase theorem, and exact verification artifacts.
